      "name": "Question 5",
      "problem": "Calculate ${lim}_{y\\to 128}{y}^{-1/7}.$",
      "worked_solution": "Applying the root rule, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{y\\to 128}{y}^{-1/7} & ={({lim}_{y\\to 128}y)}^{-1/7} \\\\  & =(128)^{-1/7} \\\\  & ={({2}^{7})}^{-1/7} \\\\  & ={2}^{-1} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
