splaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mroot><mrow><mn>10</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mroot><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><munder><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OP\">lim</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">→</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></munder><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"INNER\"><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\">(</mo><mroot><mrow><mn>10</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mroot><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><munder><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OP\">lim</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">→</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></munder><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>\nWe calculate the limits of the numerator and denominator, separately.</p>\n<p>Applying the root rule in the numerator, we have\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"65\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mtable style=\"min-width: 13.327em;\"><mjx-table><mjx-itable><mjx-mtr><mjx-mtd style=\"text-align: right; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0.3em;\"><mjx-munder><mjx-row><mjx-base style=\"padding-left: 0.038em;\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6C\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c69\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-base></mjx-row><mjx-row><mjx-under style=\"padding-top: 0.167em;\"><mjx-texatom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2192\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx